  "bodyHash": "de721b01638a17ce",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Convenient Effects 让 Minecraft 的药水效果更流畅、更智能，使用体验也更加令人满意——而且无需改变你制作药水的方式！✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">没有新增物品，没有复杂系统——只有更优质的效果。💡 感觉它本该就是 Minecraft 的一部分！🎮</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎭 更不显眼的药水粒子</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧍 第一人称视角更加清晰——粒子减少或隐藏。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ 若进行配置，也可应用于第三人称或所有实体。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🦘 跳跃提升</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">达到 2 级或更高时，无需跳跃即可直接走上整格方块！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏃 非常适合流畅跑酷和探索崎岖地形。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌫️ 失明</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">现随药水等级缩放。等级越高 = 效果越强烈。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👁️ 同样影响生物并降低其侦测距离——潜行不被发现！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 火焰抗性</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 离开熔岩或火焰后不再持续燃烧。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧯 隐藏火焰覆盖层——不再被眼前的火光晃瞎眼！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌋 在熔岩中游泳时依然视野清晰。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ 效果结束时平滑淡出——视觉效果大幅提升。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌙 夜视</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">效果结束时不再有刺眼的闪烁。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👀 享受干净、平滑的视力恢复过渡。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪶 缓慢降落</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">按住潜行键可暂时加速下落且不承受摔落伤害。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧗 非常适合鞘翅着陆、洞穴探索或登山。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric 与 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可直接通过游戏内的模组菜单进行配置（Fabric 端需安装由 Prospector 开发的 Mod Menu）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，安装 Forge Config Screens 也是必需的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目录中，命名格式为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 Raltsmc 以其 Mob Blindness 模组为灵感，启发了本模组的失明效果调整。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sword-blocking-mechanics\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/swordblockingmechanics/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/magnum-torch\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
